  "implementation": "An explicit clock policy preserves affine arc-length behavior between quintic endpoint transitions. Positive stored Bernstein increments qualify each transition; collapsed charts reject. Half windows share one literal midpoint and endpoint evaluation avoids inverse-coordinate extrapolation. Existing native constrained/geometric fits, shared cubic bases, exact restored contact proofs and complete downstream original-image admission retain their limits. Existing fitting entry point continues to select WholeInterval.",
